+Office Add-in Sideload / Publish Instructions (short)
+
+1) Host your add-in files (taskpane.html and taskpane.js) on an HTTPS endpoint accessible to your org (we provide k8s static host manifest). Example URL: https://aegis.example.com/addin/taskpane.html
+
+2) Edit services/excel/addin/manifest.xml: set <SourceLocation DefaultValue="https://aegis.example.com/addin/taskpane.html"/>
+
+Sideload for testing (Office Desktop / Online):
+ - For Office 365 tenant admin: upload the manifest via the Microsoft 365 admin center under Settings -> Integrated apps -> Add-ins -> Deploy Add-in.
+ - For individual sideload (desktop Windows): place manifest in %USERPROFILE%\AppData\Local\Microsoft\Office\16.0\WEF\ and restart Word/Excel.
+
+Publishing enterprise add-in:
+ - Use Microsoft 365 admin center and upload the XML manifest to the tenant app catalog; assign to users/groups.
+ - Ensure Azure AD app registration (ops/azure/register_azure_ad_app.sh) created and CLIENT_ID & OIDC_ISSUER configured in the proxy's k8s secret.
